      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 0,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "创新点",
          "line_tops": [
            2
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 1,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 95,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "这篇论文把“对海量病历做快速类型化判断”做成一个专用模型：CS1-4B读一遍病历文档，一次前向传播回答任意多条带选项的问题，每题返回校准概率；问题在请求时写定，换一套入组标准不需要重新训练。",
          "line_tops": [
            88,
            156,
            224,
            292,
            360
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 2,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 105,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "训练数据Klaros-12M来自MGB系统24家医院：364万患者、747万份文档、1241.6万个文档-问题对，标签混合教师模型软标签、结构化规则精确答案与真实结局。模型设计与训练数据构成见论文Fig. 1。",
          "line_tops": [
            452,
            520,
            588,
            656
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 3,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 117,
          "page": 2,
          "text": "每个答案自带校准概率：概率不低于0.95的可自动接受，其余转人工复核；答案还能按需定位到支撑它的句子。在21个外部数据集上，其顶部答案的期望校准误差为0.012–0.052，六类任务上都低于基座Nox-4B（0.033–0.139）。",
          "line_tops": [
            748,
            816,
            884,
            952,
            1020
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "column": 1,
      "content_top": 0,
      "content_bottom": 1078.59375,
      "bottom_whitespace": 233.40625,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 5,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2,
          "page": 3,
          "text": "方法",
          "line_tops": [
            865.59
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 6,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 47,
          "page": 3,
          "text": "人群筛选被框定为排序问题：GLM-5.3把试验的自由文本入组标准拆成带时间范围的原子类型问题，",
          "line_tops": [
            951.59,
            1019.59
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        4
      ],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "column": 2,
      "content_top": 4,
      "content_bottom": 1027.34375,
      "bottom_whitespace": 284.65625,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 6,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 47,
          "end": 128,
          "page": 4,
          "text": "CS1-4B对每名候选的每份文档作答，按P(eligible)=入组条满足概率之积×排除条不满足概率之积排序；大模型只读标准、不读病历。流程见论文Fig. 5a。",
          "line_tops": [
            4,
            72,
            140,
            208
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 8,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 114,
          "page": 4,
          "text": "测试设置：1,000名MIMIC-IV测试患者、21,866份文档（打包为7,695个记录单元），17项ClinicalTrials.gov注册试验、519个试验问题，CS1-4B共给出约400万个答案。配套的全病历问答框架中，",
          "line_tops": [
            764.34,
            832.34,
            900.34,
            968.34
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        7
      ],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "column": 3,
      "content_top": 4,
      "content_bottom": 1124.171875,
      "bottom_whitespace": 187.828125,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 8,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 114,
          "end": 145,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "LLM规划子问题、CS1逐文档作答，答案每个陈述都附证据引证。",
          "line_tops": [
            4,
            72
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 9,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "结果",
          "line_tops": [
            170
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 10,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 109,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "MGBQA-1M：963,408名留出患者，在14项答案键独立于训练教师的任务上领先13项；六类任务平均平衡准确率89.7，高于27B开源决策模型Vega-27B的81.7。六类任务随参数量的对比见论文Fig. 2b。",
          "line_tops": [
            256,
            324,
            392,
            460
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 12,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 45,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "21个外部数据集上平均86.7，与Vega-27B的88.6相差不到2分，推理快6.4倍。",
          "line_tops": [
            769.17,
            837.17
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 13,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 90,
          "page": 5,
          "text": "入组筛选：13项试验排序nDCG@20均值0.64，BM25关键词搜索只有0.11，13项中12项领先；top-20里判定合格患者平均3.5±2.9名，关键词搜索0.8±0.9名；",
          "line_tops": [
            929.17,
            997.17,
            1065.17
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        11
      ],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "column": 4,
      "content_top": 4,
      "content_bottom": 1009.390625,
      "bottom_whitespace": 302.609375,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 13,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 90,
          "end": 137,
          "page": 6,
          "text": "每患者LLM token消耗610对421,136，少690倍。排序结果见论文Fig. 5d。",
          "line_tops": [
            4,
            72
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 15,
          "type": "heading",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2,
          "page": 6,
          "text": "结论",
          "line_tops": [
            796.39
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 16,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 61,
          "page": 6,
          "text": "一张桌面GPU（NVIDIA GB10）每小时约读2,000份笔记、每份40问；每百万文档500 GB10小时，Vega-",
          "line_tops": [
            882.39,
            950.39
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image_blocks": [
        14
      ],
      "source_visible": false
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "column": 5,
      "content_top": 4,
      "content_bottom": 1146.6875,
      "bottom_whitespace": 165.3125,
      "fragments": [
        {
          "source_block_index": 16,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 61,
          "end": 107,
          "page": 7,
          "text": "27B要3,206小时。各系统的速度与算力见论文Extended Data Table 2。",
          "line_tops": [
            4,
            72
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_block_index": 18,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 117,
          "page": 7,
          "text": "边界：入组筛选的“合格”由盲法GLM-5.3评判给出，与写题的是同一家模型，κ=0.84只说明两遍打分一致；没有真实入组结果，未做前瞻验证；模型定位为有人在环的工具，不得对个体患者做自主决策；权重待机构审批后发布；预印本尚未同行评审。",
          "line_tops": [
            652.69,
